e":"Yishi Piao","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed784","name":"Kang Guan","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed785","name":"Aixin Liu","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed786","name":"Xin Xie","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed787","name":"Yuxiang You","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed788","name":"Kai Dong","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed789","name":"Xingkai Yu","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed78a","name":"Haowei Zhang","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed78b","name":"Liang Zhao","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed78c","name":"Yisong Wang","hidden":false},{"_id":"675f98234d67dd90e85ed78d","user":{"_id":"6398203609f12714ed1935c2","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6398203609f12714ed1935c2/uXgl0LgKnFYjq1Wz39-a6.jpeg","isPro":false,"fullname":"Chong Ruan","user":"Chester111","type":"user","name":"Chester111"},"name":"Chong Ruan","status":"claimed_verified","statusLastChangedAt":"2024-12-18T09:53:03.992Z","hidden":false}],"publishedAt":"2024-12-13T17:37:48.000Z","title":"DeepSeek-VL2: Mixture-of-Experts Vision-Language Models for Advanced\n  Multimodal Understanding","summary":"We present DeepSeek-VL2, an advanced series of large Mixture-of-Experts (MoE)\nVision-Language Models that significantly improves upon its predecessor,\nDeepSeek-VL, through two key major upgrades. For the vision component, we\nincorporate a dynamic tiling vision encoding strategy designed for processing\nhigh-resolution images with different aspect ratios. For the language\ncomponent, we leverage DeepSeekMoE models with the Multi-head Latent Attention\nmechanism, which compresses Key-Value cache into latent vectors, to enable\nefficient inference and high throughput. Trained on an improved vision-language\ndataset, DeepSeek-VL2 demonstrates superior capabilities across various tasks,\nincluding but not limited to visual question answering, optical character\nrecognition, document/table/chart understanding, and visual grounding. Our\nmodel series is composed of three variants: DeepSeek-VL2-Tiny,\nDeepSeek-VL2-Small and DeepSeek-VL2, with 1.0B, 2.8B and 4.5B activated\nparameters respectively. DeepSeek-VL2 achieves competitive or state-of-the-art\nperformance with similar or fewer activated parameters compared to existing\nopen-source dense and MoE-based models. Codes and pre-trained models are\npublicly accessible at https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-VL2.","upvotes":23,"discussionId":"675f98244d67dd90e85ed831","githubRepo":"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-vl2","githubRepoAddedBy":"auto","ai_summary":"DeepSeek-VL2, an enhanced vision-language series model, incorporates dynamic tiling for vision and latent attention for language, achieving top-tier performance in various tasks with fewer parameters.","ai_keywords":["Mixture-of-Experts (MoE)","dynamic tiling","vision encoding","Multi-head Latent Attention","latent vectors","visual question answering","optical character recognition","document/table/chart understanding","visual grounding","deepseekMoE","DeepSeek-VL2-Tiny","DeepSeek-VL2-Small","DeepSeek-VL2"],"githubStars":5281,"organization":{"_id":"652faff917096ceb6bf53f3f","name":"deepseek-ai","fullname":"DeepSeek","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6538815d1bdb3c40db94fbfa/xMBly9PUMphrFVMxLX4kq.png"}}
